  "statement": "# Sands of the Restless — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nFight through escalating undead waves, manage limited ammunition and purchases, open the sealed transition, and survive the final chamber.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA compact first-person survival campaign with two combat spaces, authored wave quotas, weapons, health and ammunition pressure, purchases, failure, and terminal victory.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose arena dressing, enemy presentation, weapon feel, wave composition, and HUD treatment while preserving the two-stage quota structure.\n"
